# error: 52:11: cannot lend `v` to write while a write loan is live
# error: 56:16: cannot lend `v` to write while a write loan is live
# error: 61:16: cannot lend `v` to write while a write loan is live
# error: 67:17: cannot lend `v` to write while a write loan is live
# error: 73:16: cannot lend `v` to write while a read loan is live
# error: 79:10: use of `v` while a write loan is live
# error: 87:16: cannot move `v` while a write loan is live
# error: 94:13: cannot lend `v` to write while a write loan is live
# errors: 11
